lpha – Expect bugs, shutdowns & balance changes\n\nGame Credits: https://devforum.roblox.com/t/4273432","path":"/game/100555622228395-tripmine-trouble","slug":"100555622228395-tripmine-trouble","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f60e4e7f5aceef8661a9ac40d7cb4744483fd00bf2b85207423843902b5784e6.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d53eacb8cfe819fff453ae37390a1d00/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":1947923,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T18:14:48.327Z","creator":{"name":"Abracadabra","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":121727847541143,"name":"Dungeon Lootify [BETA]","desc":"🔥 Grab your sword, rally your crew, and dive into dungeons teeming with treasure and terror! 🔥\n\n[How To Play]\n• 🤝 Team Up – Gather allies around the table to start your party\n• 🏹 Risk It All – Battle monsters and colossal bosses... but BEWARE: Death means losing everything!\n• 💎 Get Rich or Die Trying – Loot chests for legendary gear... then decide: push deeper for greater rewards, or flee to safety!\n\nPro Tip: The deeper you go, the deadlier the traps — and the juicier the prizes! Fortune favors the bold… but only the living keep their gold.\n\nThis game is still in Alpha and will be updated every week. If you meet any problems, please post on our group wall or in our dc server!","path":"/game/121727847541143-dungeon-lootify","slug":"121727847541143-dungeon-lootify","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/55bfc053d3c0c83d0d5e2414e63811586af2ab39f9393beff228b9507f1edd56.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bec450c324efacd82c2d3d4dedcf447b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":17577854,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-10T04:53:51.819Z","creator":{"name":"Big Coder","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":105344022671234,"name":"Milky [Beta]","desc":"Welcome to Milky — where numbers go up, your sanity goes down, and a tree is more than just branches. It's a lifestyle.\n\nIn this game, you’ll:\n🧱 Build the ultimate upgrade tree, and lactose tolerance\n⏫ Watch your stats skyrocket with absurdly broken mechanics\n💥 Reset, prestige, ascend, and question reality\n🐄 Possibly milk a cow. Spiritually.\n\nWhether you're into watching numbers rise, endlessly upgrading, or just really like incrementals, this game’s for you.\n\n🎉 Stop reading. Play it. Your unlimited empire awaits. 🎉\n\n🌟 Premium Perk: +20% Stats (yes, really)\n📢 v0.1.2 - Still early! Join our community to see what's next. (13+)\n\n⚠️ No exploits — we see all 🧀\n(Macros that repeat through that one sequence? Yeah, we cool with that.)","path":"/game/105344022671234-milky","slug":"105344022671234-milky","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/cbe951120e8c2d3a9b12e47aebb8fdb769dbc53abdc109435a2d4663f82db690.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5fe799b5c748ff08b6140238beb2b0a8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":3609726,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-08-10T13:41:30.800Z","creator":{"name":"Ultimate Engineers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":123068038613059,"name":"IQ 0 Jump Rope Glass Bridge 🧠","desc":"IQ 0 Jump Rope Glass Bridge 🧠\nCan you survive BOTH the Jump Rope and Glass Bridge?\n\n🧠 Think fast, time your jumps, or fall like the rest!\n🎁 Wait 15 minutes to get a OP gift!\n⚠️ Watch out! Other players can troll you with powerful slaps!\n\n👍 Like and ⭐ Favorite for updates and rewards!\n\nTags: Squid Game, Jump Rope, Glass Bridge, Impossible Challenge, Obby, Survival, Season 3, $1,000,000, Red Light Green Light, Rich, Troll, IQ Test, Easy","path":"/game/123068038613059-iq-0-jump-rope-glass-bridge","slug":"123068038613059-iq-0-jump-rope-glass-bridge","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6e6d5f7e90e30db0db97a694d0282cb147d0687bac7390df4d917e28c8494087.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-654fe94dd4ce16900d77c8e590b68c8d/150/1